  "instance_name": "racist_analogies",
  "label": "Racist Analogies",
  "description": "The meme uses an analogy where animals are used to represent human groups, which is a common tactic in racist and xenophobic propaganda. This type of analogy dehumanizes the 'other' and makes it easier to justify harmful stereotypes and policies. The goat as the 'native' speaker and the smaller animals as 'invaders' is a visual metaphor that relies on real-world racial and ethnic hierarchies and power dynamics.",
